  "defects": [
    "A raw desktop release request could create a tag without exact canonical consent and fall back to another branch/workflow.",
    "Installer polling could substitute an unrelated latest release, accept an unbound asset URL and publish held credential content from an asset name.",
    "Provider network, stream and malformed-JSON errors could expose private material.",
    "A pending workflow approval could be mislabeled as an execution failure or blocked by an unrelated pending portable upload."
